    {
      "name": "finalize",
      "docs": [
        "Finalize / Settlement — permissionless, siapa saja bisa trigger",
        "",
        "Logic:",
        "1. Non-submitters → auto-fail",
        "2. Submitted Success but disputed by >50% of others → fail",
        "3. Rest → winner",
        "4. Distribution:",
        "- Winners always get their original stake back in full",
        "- Loser stake becomes penalty_pool",
        "- Fee is charged only from penalty_pool",
        "- Remaining penalty_pool is split among winners",
        "- All win → full refunds, no fee",
        "- All fail → refunds minus fee, split equally across participants",
        "",
        "remaining_accounts layout:",
        "[ParticipantState_0, TokenAccount_0, CommitmentProfile_0, ParticipantState_1, TokenAccount_1, CommitmentProfile_1, ...]"
      ],
